# reading it; see sessions/README.md.
sessions/**/*.m4a
sessions/**/*.flac
sessions/**/*.wav

.history/

.timeline_data/

# Pass-3 player-facing story output. Was the story/the-compass-edge submodule
# (github.com/JoJoAtkinson/story-the-compass-edge), detached 2026-08-22.
/story/
/output/
# Generated timeline SVGs should publish into `docs/` (Pages), not under `world/`.
world/**/_history.*.svg
world/**/_timeline.*.svg

